Third-party software
--------------------
C3 does not bundle or redistribute Claude Code. The runtime Dockerfile installs
the official `@anthropic-ai/claude-code` npm package when the image is built in
the user's own AWS account. Its use is governed by Anthropic's terms:
https://code.claude.com/docs/en/legal-and-compliance

The runtime image also installs, at build time:
- `mcp-proxy-for-aws-cli` (Apache-2.0), https://github.com/aws/mcp-proxy-for-aws
- `uv` (Apache-2.0 / MIT), https://github.com/astral-sh/uv
- the official Node.js Docker image and Debian packages
- optionally the AWS CLI v2, https://aws.amazon.com/cli/
- `@aws-sdk/client-s3` (Apache-2.0) for optional session storage
